  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 0.2.3\n\n- Align the package version with the readable contract JSON release; mock client behavior is unchanged.\n\n## 0.2.2\n\n- Expose hosted authoring validation for response headers, content types, UTF-8 body size and route patterns.\n- Validate patterns with the same matcher used at runtime and preserve desktop source parity.\n- Apply the public host allowlist for authoring; the embedded server package retains its configurable header policy.\n\n## 0.2.1\n\n- Correct public documentation and product links.\n- Align the package version with the Echo package release and include NuGet release notes and symbols.\n\n## 0.2.0\n\n- Read the hierarchical rule feed shared with the mock server package.\n- Preserve the explicit opt-in for each HTTP client and the existing production and failure guards.",
